- summarize.py: imports all data models from data_models.py
- No circular references; all modules compile cleanly

Impact: Resolved without code loss; actually improved architecture by isolating data models.

Lesson: Shared data structures should be in separate module to avoid circular dependencies; separating data from logic prevents import cycles.

